      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِحْرَافٌ</span></b>  (S, L, K) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِحْرَفٌ</span></b> , (L, TA,) or
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِحْرَفَةٌ</span></b> , (Akh, TA,) <i>A probe with which the
depth of a wound is measured:</i> (S, L, K:) pl. of
the first <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَحَارِيفُ</span>; and [of the second, or,] accord.
to Akh, of the last, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَحَارِفُ</span>. (TA.)

